OL,3,GNEWSAFlynn's office emailed over ferry
OL,4,Agas leak before he denied knowing about
OL,5,Ait
OL,6,
OL,7,FTransport Secretary Stephen Flynn told
OL,8,Fa Holyrood committee he knew nothing
OL,9,Fabout a gas leak on a CalMac ferry,
OL,10,Fdespite records showing his office had
OL,11,Fbeen emailed about the incident.
OL,13,FA faulty valve led to 700kg of methane
OL,14,Fgas being vented from the side of MV
OL,15,FGlen Sannox while it was carrying
OL,16,Fpassengers from Arran to Troon in June
OL,17,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
