OL,3,GNEWSAFlynn's office emailed over ferry
OL,4,Agas leak before he denied knowing about
OL,5,Ait
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlynn claimed he missed a BBC Scotland
OL,8,Freport on the incident as he was
OL,9,Ffacetiming his children before he
OL,10,Fappeared in front of the transport
OL,11,Fcommittee last month.
OL,13,FBut a briefing document released via a
OL,14,Ffreedom of information (FOI) request
OL,15,Fshowed Flynn's office was contacted
OL,16,Fabout the story twice in the hours
OL,17,Fbetween publication and his committee
OL,18,Fappearance.
